# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
    flask.testsuite
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

    Tests Flask itself.  The majority of Flask is already tested
    as part of Werkzeug.

    :copyright: (c) 2011 by Armin Ronacher.
